<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
<title>404 - 页面不存在</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --primary: #2563eb;
    --primary-hover: #1d4ed8;
    --text: #1f2937;
    --text-light: #6b7280;
    --bg: #f8fafc;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --border: #e5e7eb;
  }

  * {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  html, body {
    height: 100%;
  }

  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "PingFang SC",
                 "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 24px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  .wrap {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 640px;
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 48px 40px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .code {
    font-size: 96px;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #7c3aed);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    color: transparent;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .desc {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .tips {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin: 20px 0 28px;
    text-align: left;
    background: #f1f5f9;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
  }

  .tips p {
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .tips ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
  }

  .tips li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .tips li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 10px;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--primary);
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 10px 22px;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all .2s ease;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--primary-hover);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25);
  }

  .btn-ghost {
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--text);
    border-color: var(--border);
  }

  .btn-ghost:hover {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .nav {
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--border);
    padding-top: 24px;
  }

  .nav-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-light);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    letter-spacing: .5px;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 10px 18px;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .nav-links a {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    transition: background .2s ease;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover {
    background: #eff6ff;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .footer {
    margin-top: 28px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #9ca3af;
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .wrap {
      padding: 32px 22px;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
    .code {
      font-size: 72px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 18px;
    }
    .btn {
      flex: 1 1 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="wrap">
    <div class="code">404</div>
    <h1>抱歉，您访问的页面不存在</h1>
    <p class="desc">页面可能已被删除、重命名，或者输入的网址有误。</p>

    <div class="tips">
      <p>您可以尝试以下方式：</p>
      <ul>
        <li>检查网址是否输入正确，注意大小写和拼写</li>
        <li>返回上一页，重新选择入口链接</li>
        <li>通过下方的导航链接进入您感兴趣的内容</li>
        <li>如果是从搜索引擎点进来的，可以回到搜索结果换一个链接</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

<form action="/so/search.php" method="get" style="margin-bottom:20px; display:flex; gap:8px;">
  <input type="text" name="q" placeholder="搜索站内内容..."
         style="flex:1; padding:10px 14px; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:8px; font-size:14px; outline:none;">
  <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">搜索</button>
</form>

    <div class="actions">
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">返回首页</a>
      <a href="javascript:history.back()" class="btn btn-ghost">返回上一页</a>
    </div>

    <nav class="nav">
      <div class="nav-title">— 快速导航 —</div>
